"unique: \"Rhino\" tank, \"Ceramite plates\"":"unik: tank \"Badak\", \"Pelat keramit\"",
"Consortium. From 12:00. Builds the super-heavy tank \"Bastion\" (one per army).":"Konsorsium. Sejak menit 12:00. Merakit tank superberat \"Benteng\" (satu per pasukan).",
