"\"Bastion\" and \"Reaper\": from 12:00 (skipped here), plant, assembly, orders, weak spots, possession":"\"Benteng\" dan \"Penuai\": mulai 12:00 (di sini dilewati), pabrik, perakitan, perintah, titik lemah, pengendalian",
