"New vehicles: Jackal raider, Grad MLRS (homing rockets), Hammer mortar; the Swarm gets Wasp, Hive, Trebuchet":"Kenderaan baharu: perompak \"Serigala\", MLRS \"Grad\" (roket pencari sasaran), mortar \"Tukul\"; Kawanan mendapat \"Tebuan\", \"Sarang\", \"Trebuchet\"",
"The strategist keeps orders and stops voice spam; fights come to you; B — redeploy, Shift+B — into the fight; compass, H — which target":"Ahli strategi tidak mengubah arahan dan berhenti spam suara; pertempuran datang kepada anda; B — pindah, Shift+B — ke tengah pertempuran; kompas, H — sasaran mana",
"Camera fly-over when switching, portal aurora instead of rings":"Kamera terbang lintas semasa bertukar, aurora portal menggantikan gelang",
"Hints (pop-ups and curator)":"Petunjuk (pop timbul dan Pemandu)",
"Squad chatter":"Perbualan skuad",
"Shooter — click to rebind":"Penembak — klik untuk tukar kekunci",
"Mouse: LMB — fire, RMB — aim, Shift — jetpack. Tank: LMB — cannon, RMB — MG. M — sound, O — quality, Esc — menu.":"Tetikus: klik kiri — tembak, klik kanan — bidik, Shift — jetpack. Kereta kebal: klik kiri — meriam, klik kanan — MG. M — bunyi, O — kualiti, Esc — menu.",
