"The objective is far. {0} — drop pod straight to it (with your squad). Shift+{1} — possess a trooper in the thick of the fight.":"Objektif jauh. {0} — pod pendaratan terus ke sana (bersama skuad anda). Shift+{1} — Kawal seorang askar di tengah pertempuran.",
"Intel: a Swarm squad is heading your way — {0}, about {1} meters.":"Risikan: skuad Kawanan menuju ke arah anda — {0}, kira-kira {1} meter.",
