"Needs {0} CP, you have {1}":"Potrebuje {0} PT, imaš {1}",
"CP come from: +1 per captured point, +1 every 75 s (next in {0}), a little for kills.":"Poveljniške točke dobiš: +1 za zavzeto točko, +1 vsakih 75 s (naslednja čez {0}), malo za uničene sovražnike.",
"Nowhere to retreat — no HQ or outposts":"Ni se kam umakniti — ni štaba ali predstraž",
"Waiting for ore — will be ordered automatically":"Čaka na rudo — naročilo bo oddano samodejno",
"Reload · tank barrage":"Ponovno polnjenje · salva tanka",
"Grenade · tank overdrive":"Granata · turbo tanka",
"AI strategist on/off":"UI-strateg vkl/izkl",
"Comms online. The strategist is on the line. Good luck, trooper.":"Zveza vzpostavljena. Strateg je na zvezi. Srečno, vojak.",
"New vehicles: Jackal raider, Grad MLRS (homing rockets), Hammer mortar; the Swarm gets Wasp, Hive, Trebuchet":"Nova vozila: jurišnik »Šakal«, raketometalec »Grad« (samonavodljive rakete), minomet »Kladivo«; Roj dobi »Oso«, »Panj«, »Trebušet«",
"Squad with me ↔ going solo":"Oddelek z mano ↔ delujem sam",
"The objective is far. {0} — drop pod straight to it (with your squad). Shift+{1} — possess a trooper in the thick of the fight.":"Cilj je daleč. {0} — kapsula naravnost k cilju (skupaj z oddelkom). Shift+{1} — prevzemi nadzor nad vojakom v vrvežu boja.",
"Intel: a Swarm squad is heading your way — {0}, about {1} meters.":"Izvidništvo: oddelek Roja gre proti vam — {0}, približno {1} metrov.",
"Squad chatter":"Radijske zveze oddelka",
