"Select a squad and tap the green \"▶ Possess\" button — back into battle as that trooper. While you shoot, the AI strategist runs the army.":"Izaberi odred i dodirni zeleno dugme \"▶ Preuzmi\" — opet u borbu kao taj vojnik. Dok ti pucaš, AI strateg sam komanduje vojskom.",
"Select a squad and press {0} or the green \"▶ Possess\" — back into battle as that trooper (nothing selected — your own). While you shoot, the AI strategist runs the army.":"Izaberi odred i pritisni {0} ili zeleno \"▶ Preuzmi\" — opet u borbu kao taj vojnik (ako ništa nije izabrano — u svog). Dok ti pucaš, AI strateg sam komanduje vojskom.",
"In the air, C is the jet brake. Stop, turn with the mouse and thrust again.":"U vazduhu C je kočnica džetpeka. Zaustavi se, okreni se mišem i ponovo daj potisak.",
"Drone: {0}/{1} — up/down, LMB — fire, {2} — ram your aim point.":"Dron: {0}/{1} — gore/dole, LTM — paljba, {2} — udar u tačku nišana.",
"Select a squad — LMB, drag a box or a card on the left. RMB on the ground — attack-move ⚔, on an enemy — attack, on a point — capture.":"Izaberi odred — LTM, okvirom ili karticom levo. DTM po zemlji — napadno kretanje ⚔, po neprijatelju — napad, po tački — zauzimanje.",
"Only builders construct buildings: select a builder (button in the Build tab or a building key), then click the spot. An extractor (C) on a glowing vein — more ore.":"Zgrade grade samo inženjeri: izaberi inženjera (dugme na kartici \"Gradnja\" ili taster zgrade), pa klikni na mesto. Ekstraktor (C) na svetlećoj žili — više rude.",
"Select a unit and tap the green \"▶ Possess\" below (or double tap) to fight yourself. \"◩ Strategy\" brings you back.":"Izaberi jedinicu i dodirni zeleno dugme \"▶ Preuzmi\" dole (ili dupli dodir) — boriš se sam. \"◩ Strategija\" te vraća nazad.",
"Select a unit and press the green \"▶ Possess\" below or {0} (or double-click) to fight yourself. In battle {1} brings you back.":"Izaberi jedinicu i pritisni zeleno dugme \"▶ Preuzmi\" dole ili {0} (ili dvoklik) — boriš se sam. U borbi te {1} vraća u strategiju.",
"Camera: WASD and screen edges, Q/E rotate, wheel zoom (to cursor), MMB orbit, minimap — click or drag, Space — to the latest alert.":"Kamera: WASD i ivice ekrana, Q/E — rotacija, točkić — zum (ka kursoru), STM — orbita, minimapa — klik ili prevlačenje, Razmak — do poslednjeg alarma.",
