"A silo next to the HQ: pods, supply crates and bombers launch from here through the sky portal. Nothing can be built on it.":"Silos kraj štaba: odavde kroz nebeski portal do mete polaze kapsule, sanduci sa zalihama i bombarderi. Na njemu se ne može graditi.",
