"Railgun from afar. Stays back, fragile up close.":"Bunduki ya reli hupiga kutoka mbali. Hubaki nyuma, dhaifu kwa karibu.",
"Drone":"Ndege-nyuki",
"Our {0} destroyed":"{0} wetu ameharibiwa",
"Drone limit":"Kikomo cha ndege-nyuki",
"Boosted jetpack":"Mkoba wa roketi ulioboreshwa",
"Jetpack fuel ×1.5.":"Mafuta ya mkoba wa roketi ×1.5.",
"captured {0}":"umeteka {0}",
"The strategist issued an experimental MG for 90 s (key 3)":"Mkakati wa AI ametoa bunduki ya mashine ya majaribio kwa 90 s (kitufe 3)",
"HQ awarded +2 command points":"Makao Makuu yametoa +2 pointi za amri",
"Welcome to the meteor! You are a Consortium combat robot. Look around with the mouse and walk with WASD.":"Karibu kwenye kimondo! Wewe ni roboti ya kivita ya Konsotiamu. Tazama pande zote kwa kipanya na tembea kwa WASD.",
"Jetpack: tap Shift to hop, hold Shift to fly. Energy recharges on the ground.":"Mkoba wa roketi: gusa Shift kuruka kidogo, shikilia Shift kupaa. Nishati hujazwa ukiwa ardhini.",
"Next to a tank or turret press E to take control. Or just carry on.":"Ukiwa karibu na kifaru au mnara wa silaha, bonyeza E ili kuchukua udhibiti. Au endelea tu na safari.",
"Select a squad and tap the green \"▶ Possess\" button — back into battle as that trooper. While you shoot, the AI strategist runs the army.":"Chagua kikosi na ugonge kitufe cha kijani \"▶ Dhibiti\" — unarudi vitani kama askari huyo. Wakati unapiga risasi, mkakati wa AI anaongoza jeshi.",
"Select a squad and press {0} or the green \"▶ Possess\" — back into battle as that trooper (nothing selected — your own). While you shoot, the AI strategist runs the army.":"Chagua kikosi na bonyeza {0} au \"▶ Dhibiti\" ya kijani — unarudi vitani kama askari huyo (bila uteuzi — wako mwenyewe). Wakati unapiga risasi, mkakati wa AI anaongoza jeshi.",
"Training complete! The Swarm is launching its offensive. Good luck, trooper!":"Mafunzo yamekamilika! Kundi la Nyuki linaanza mashambulizi. Kila la heri, askari!",
"⇑ — jetpack: tap to hop, hold to fly. ◎ — aim.":"⇑ — mkoba wa roketi: gusa kuruka kidogo, shikilia kupaa. ◎ — lenga.",
"In the air, ⤓ is the jet brake.":"Hewani, ⤓ ni breki ya mkoba wa roketi.",
"Shift — jump pack: tap to hop, hold to fly. RMB — aim.":"Shift — mkoba wa roketi: gusa kuruka kidogo, shikilia kupaa. Kitufe cha kulia — lenga.",
"In the air, C is the jet brake. Stop, turn with the mouse and thrust again.":"Hewani, C ni breki ya mkoba wa roketi. Simama, geuka kwa kipanya kisha toa msukumo tena.",
"Your robot is badly damaged. Get out of the fire — armor self-repairs out of combat.":"Roboti yako imeharibika vibaya. Toka kwenye moto — ngao hujirekebisha nje ya mapambano.",
"Drone: {0}/{1} — up/down, LMB — fire, {2} — ram your aim point.":"Ndege-nyuki: {0}/{1} — juu/chini, kitufe cha kushoto — fyatua, {2} — gonga shabaha yako.",
"Plenty of ore — select the HQ or a factory and order troops in its panel on the right.":"Madini ghafi ni mengi — chagua Makao Makuu au kiwanda na uagize wanajeshi kwenye paneli yake kulia.",
"Only builders construct buildings: select a builder (button in the Build tab or a building key), then click the spot. An extractor (C) on a glowing vein — more ore.":"Wahandisi pekee ndio hujenga majengo: chagua mhandisi (kitufe kwenye kichupo cha Jenga au kitufe cha jengo), kisha bofya mahali. Kichimbaji (C) kwenye mshipa unaong'aa — madini ghafi zaidi.",
"RMB — attack-move ⚔: they stop to fight enemies they meet, then continue. Double RMB — march »: run without stopping, firing on the move. Hold/Retreat — \"More orders ▾\".":"Kitufe cha kulia — shambulia ukisonga ⚔: wakikutana na adui wanasimama kupigana kisha wanaendelea. Kitufe cha kulia mara mbili — mwendo wa haraka »: wanakimbia bila kusimama, wakifyatua wakiwa njiani. Simama/Rudi nyuma — \"Amri zaidi ▾\".",
