"You play the Swarm: tunnel burrow, exit up to 220 m, dust warning, squads and vehicles through":"Unacheza Kundi la Nyuki: shimo la handaki, kutokea hadi m 220, onyo la vumbi, vikosi na magari kupita handakini",
