"Your units sometimes ask for help: a radio call, a REQUEST card and a ✋ marker. A squad is pinned — destroy the enemies near it. Reward: a trooper by pod from the base, a gun from a buggy trunk, the gunner seat or orbital cover. Not now — ✕ or just ignore it.":"Wenzako wakati mwingine huomba msaada: ujumbe wa redio, kadi ya \"OMBI\" na alama ya ✋. Kikosi kimebanwa — teketeza maadui walio karibu nacho. Zawadi: askari kwa kapsuli kutoka kituoni, bunduki kutoka nyuma ya gari dogo, kiti cha mpiga risasi au ulinzi wa obiti. Hutaki — bonyeza ✕ au upuuze tu.",
"The front is stuck — HQ offers a breakthrough. Y — accept. Hold the relay for 8 s with no foes near: the enemy map is revealed for 60 s. The generator — enemy turrets go silent for 2 min. In Strategist — \"Assign a squad\". The enemy can do it too: watch for ⚠.":"Mstari wa mbele umekwama — Makao Makuu yanatoa mageuzi. Y — kubali. Shikilia kituo cha mawasiliano sekunde 8 bila maadui karibu: ramani ya adui inaonekana sekunde 60. Jenereta — minara ya adui kimya dakika 2. Katika hali ya Mkakati — \"Mpe kikosi\". Adui naye anaweza: angalia ⚠.",
