"Main battle tank: cannon and MG. Consortium \"Bulldog\" is tougher, Swarm \"Spider\" is faster.":"Kifaru kikuu cha vita: kanuni na bunduki ya rashasha. Konsotiamu wana \"Bulldog\" (imara zaidi), Kundi la Nyuki wana \"Spider\" (kasi zaidi).",
"Autonomous flying gunner: fast, fragile, fears anti-air.":"Mpiga risasi anayeruka kivyake: mwepesi, dhaifu, anaogopa bunduki za kuangusha ndege.",
"Longer, faster jetpacks for all infantry.":"Mikoba ya roketi ya masafa marefu na kasi zaidi kwa askari wote wa miguu.",
"Fast machines, drone packs, tunnels and regeneration. Lighter but faster infantry; cannons and rails hit harder.":"Mashine za haraka, makundi ya ndege-nyuki, mahandaki na kujiponya. Askari wepesi zaidi lakini wa kasi; kanuni na reli hupiga kwa nguvu zaidi.",
"Drift":"Kuelea",
"Sometimes left after an anomaly is discharged. Always a plus and a minus, last 3 minutes.":"Wakati mwingine huachwa baada ya hitilafu kutulizwa. Siku zote kuna faida na hasara, hudumu dakika 3.",
"Verdans":"Verdani",
"A humming green crystal that pulses around itself — it flashes before each pulse.":"Fuwele ya kijani inayovuma na kupiga mapigo kuzunguka — humetameta kabla ya kila mpigo.",
"Frost on the ground, 2 s of hissing — then a steam column: freeze (−60% speed, +40% blast damage, 8 s). Snow.":"Barafu ardhini, kuzomea kwa 2 s — kisha nguzo ya mvuke: kuganda (−60% kasi, +40% madhara ya milipuko, 8 s). Theluji.",
"A 6×30 m strip of haze pushes units, jetpacks and even projectiles; direction changes every 2 minutes. Autumn.":"Utepe wa ukungu wa 6×30 m husukuma vitengo, mikoba ya roketi na hata makombora; mwelekeo hubadilika kila dakika 2. Vuli.",
"A meadow of steel dandelions: fluff sticks and corrodes armour −2/s, jumps to neighbours on contact.":"Uwanda wa maua ya dandelioni ya chuma: manyoya hunata na kutafuna ganda −2/s, huruka kwa wa jirani wakigusana.",
"A rootstock with vines: barely moves, lashes everyone nearby (damage and knockback).":"Kiazi cha mizizi chenye mitambaazi: hakitembei sana, hupiga kwa mtambaazi wote walio karibu (madhara na kurusha nyuma).",
"Armoured and slow, bullets barely work; anger it and it rams.":"Ana ganda na anakwenda polepole, risasi karibu hazimdhuru; ukimkasirisha anagonga kwa nguvu.",
"Keep your distance or escape by jetpack.":"Weka umbali au ondoka kwa mkoba wa roketi.",
"Dust and basalt, caps around the HQs, lava. Standard combat rules.":"Vumbi na basalti, kofia kuzunguka Makao Makuu, lava. Kanuni za kawaida za vita.",
"Autumn leaves: footsteps are louder — the enemy hears runners at 32 m. Draughts and Steel fluff appear here.":"Majani ya vuli: nyayo husikika zaidi — adui husikia wanaokimbia kwa 32 m. Hapa huonekana Upepo wa mwanya na Manyoya ya Chuma.",
"Top view: building, production, group orders, CP support. LMB select, RMB order; on phone — taps and the build panel.":"Mwonekano wa juu: ujenzi, uzalishaji, amri kwa vikundi, msaada wa PA. Kitufe cha kushoto — chagua, kitufe cha kulia — amri; kwenye simu — kugusa na paneli ya ujenzi.",
"First-person combat as any trooper or vehicle. Jetpack, slide, grenade, rocket, reflex, artillery, rifle-butt melee.":"Vita kwa mtazamo wa mtu wa kwanza kama askari yeyote au gari. Mkoba wa roketi, kuteleza, bomu la mkono, roketi, mwitikio wa haraka, shambulio la mizinga, pigo la kitako.",
