"RMB — attack-move, double RMB — march firing on the move; rare orders in \"More orders ▾\"; no duplicate buttons":"右鍵 — 攻擊移動，連點右鍵 — 邊走邊開火行軍；少用的命令放在「更多命令 ▾」；按鈕不重複",
"Shooter-grade guns: hitscan bullets, 720 RPM rifle, MG, recoil, RMB aim, magazines and R reload, hit markers":"射擊手感比照射擊遊戲：即時命中的子彈、每分鐘 720 發的步槍、機槍、後座力、右鍵瞄準、彈匣與 R 換彈、命中標記",
"Heavier gravity, responsive jetpack, dash on Z or double jet in the air; the weapon no longer flies along when switching units":"重力更強、噴射背包更靈敏，Z 或在空中連按兩次噴射背包可衝刺；切換單位時武器不再跟著飛走",
"Builders: select a builder, pick a building, place a blueprint; extractors on ore veins; click \"ORE\" to see income and how to boost it":"工程兵：選取工程兵，挑選建築，放置藍圖；採礦機建在礦脈上；點擊「礦石」查看收入來源與加速方法",
"Grey buttons explain why and offer a fix; bigger buttons, \"In progress\" strip, \"▶ Possess\", Tab is the one mode key":"灰色按鈕也能點，會告訴你原因並提供解決按鈕；按鈕更大、「進行中」欄、「▶ 附身」，Tab 是唯一的模式切換鍵",
"Strategy camera without jumps or flips, zoom to cursor, draggable minimap":"戰略視角不再跳動或翻轉，縮放以游標為中心，小地圖可拖曳",
"New vehicles: Jackal raider, Grad MLRS (homing rockets), Hammer mortar; the Swarm gets Wasp, Hive, Trebuchet":"新載具：「豺狼」突襲車、「冰雹」多管火箭砲（追蹤火箭彈）、「重錘」迫擊砲；蜂群新增「黃蜂」、「蜂巢」、「投石機」",
"The strategist keeps orders and stops voice spam; fights come to you; B — redeploy, Shift+B — into the fight; compass, H — which target":"AI 戰略官不再亂改命令也不再語音洗版；戰鬥會在你附近展開；B — 空降調度，Shift+B — 投入戰場；羅盤，H — 切換目標",
"Free play (K) and going solo (J), F2 presets; Esc pauses and resumes; saves: slots, export and import":"自由行動（K）與單獨行動（J），F2 預設組合；Esc 暫停並可返回；存檔：欄位、匯出與匯入檔案",
"Flight: stronger gravity far from the meteor, C in the air brakes, thrust steers sharper; no more getting stuck in the portal":"飛行：遠離隕石時重力更強，在空中按 C 煞車，推力轉向更敏銳；不再卡在傳送門裡",
